WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.793
- I've ordered a million
paint by numbers sets--

00:00:03.793 --> 00:00:06.440
- That'sーI love coloring so much.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.790
Like, I never thought I'd be the girl

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:08.730
with adult coloring books,

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.127
but my kids are coloring
so much, and I'm like,

00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:11.907
"Okay, I'm done with
princesses, at this point.

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:14.180
"I've gotta color something else."

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.070
It's actually very therapeutic.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.600
- Yeah, I love doing it.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.920
I was really into it, at the beginning,

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.260
and then, I sort of got out of it,

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.860
and now, I think I'm gonna dive back in.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:24.750
- Yeah. I mean, well,

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.380
there's only so much to do,
when you're stuck in your house.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:28.310
- True.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:30.010
- Can I seeーdo you have anything?

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:30.843
Can we see?

00:00:30.843 --> 00:00:32.090
- I do.
- Oh, you do?

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.200
Oh, good.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.510
- I brought it.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.650
I brought it, in case you wanted to see my

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.466
beautiful work.
- What?

00:00:39.466 --> 00:00:40.670
(Dakota laughs)

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.160
Okay, Dakota.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.873
Mine aren't looking anything like that.

00:00:43.873 --> 00:00:46.120
- Oh, and I even date it in the corner.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.080
Yes, very professional.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.050
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.170
I'm not even kidding you.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.390
I was thinking, like, water.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.390
Maybe I'm an idiot, and
still stuck in the '80s.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:56.330
I was thinking, like, you
know, watercolor things.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.010
- I've done that, too.
- Not like that.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:01.430
This is actually by a
brand, called Pink Picasso,

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.060
and they're like the
fancy paint by number.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.020
It's like actually a canvas and like--

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.430
- Next level watercolor.
- I know, I was gonna get,

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:09.530
I can't, obviously.

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:10.363
It's all, you know,

00:01:10.363 --> 00:01:12.690
it's just about filling in the little--

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:14.020
- No, I can promise you,

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.840
if I did that, girl, it
would not come out like that.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.042
I'm not, that's not my kind of creativity.

00:01:17.042 --> 00:01:18.842
- I was impressed. I kinda liked it.

